This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-mender-beagle layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Dependencies
============

  URI: https://git.openembedded.org/openembedded-core
  layer: meta
  branch: wrynose

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-yocto
  layers: meta-poky, meta-yocto-bsp
  branch: wrynose

  URI: https://github.com/mendersoftware/meta-mender
  layers: meta-mender-core
  branch: master-next

For BeaglePlay (TI AM625), additionally:

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-ti
  layers: meta-ti-bsp, meta-beagle
  branch: wrynose

Contributions
=============

Please see the README file in the top level directory.

Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-mender-beagle layer to your build
 II. Supported boards


I. Adding the meta-mender-beagle layer to your build
====================================================

Run 'bitbake-layers add-layer meta-mender-beagle'

II. Supported boards
====================

The supported and tested boards are:

  - BeagleBone Black (https://hub.mender.io/t/beaglebone-black/83)
  - BeaglePlay (TI AM625)
